	(text "Update:\n1. Switch pins for multiplexer ADC and latch disable, \n	use ADC1 for ADC(unless ADC2 issue can be resolved)\n2. Change button to 6*6\n3. Switch 5V and GND for valve\n4. Reduce pull down to only 1 for sensor ADC on main\n5. Use multiplexer for valve MOSFET as well\n6. battery NPN 2N3904S-RTK/PS replace with 2SC1623/BC847"
